govulncheck found 1 vulnerability; this PR fixes 1:

**[GO-2026-6061](https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-6061)**: Ambiguity after a module carve-out in google.golang.org/grpc

    google.golang.org/grpc v1.52.0 -> v1.82.1
